17. Combining DataFrames

Extremely important for real-world projects.

| Function / Method | Use                                        | Example                       |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |
| `concat()`        | Combine DataFrames                         | `pd.concat([df1, df2])`       |
| `merge()`         | Join DataFrames                            | `pd.merge(df1, df2, on="ID")` |
| `join()`          | Join using index                           | `df1.join(df2)`               |
| `combine_first()` | Fill missing values from another DataFrame | `df1.combine_first(df2)`      |


